readme.text:
宿主半侧在 `webServer` 上注册五条同源路由（跨站 / `sec-fetch-site: cross-site` / `Origin: null` 一律 403）：

```
GET  /history-purge/state      -> { sessions[], trash[], stats }
POST /history-purge/delete     { ids: string[], permanent?: boolean, force?: boolean }
POST /history-purge/restore    { entries: string[] }
POST /history-purge/purge      { entries?: string[], empty?: boolean }

正在运行的会话默认拒删（`force: true` 才放行）——删盘但 Agent 还在跑，下一次 flush 会把日志写回来。
